@startuml

title ShikigamiApp Scenario Runner - Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Form" {
   class MainForm
}

package "Scenario" {
   class Scenario {
       + string FilePath
       + int StartLine
       + int EndLine
       + IReadOnlyList<ScenarioStep> Steps
   }
   class ScenarioStep {
       + int LineNumber
       + ScenarioCommandType CommandType
       + IReadOnlyList<string> Arguments
       + string RawText
   }
   enum ScenarioCommandType {
       OpenGui
       CloseGui
       SelectShikigami
       LoadMitama
       Calculate
       Clear
       ReloadShikigami
       BreakShikigamiHeader
       CheckCalculation
       CheckShikigami
   }
   class ScenarioLoader
   class ScenarioParser
   class ScenarioValidator
}

package "Execution" {
   class ScenarioExecutor
   class ScenarioCommandExecutor
   class ScenarioExecutionContext {
       + string ScenarioPath
       + GuiSession GuiSession
       + ScenarioExecutionOptions Options
   }
   class ScenarioExecutionOptions {
       + bool WatchMode
       + bool KeepGuiOpenOnFailure
   }
   class ScenarioExecutionResult {
       + bool IsSuccess
       + int PassedCount
       + int FailedCount
       + TimeSpan Elapsed
       + int FailedLineNumber
       + string ErrorMessage
   }
}

package "Automation" {
   class GuiSession {
       + Application Application
       + AutomationBase Automation
       + Window MainWindow
   }
   class GuiOperator
   class ShikigamiOperator
   class MitamaOperator
   class CalculationOperator
   class ShikigamiDataOperator
   class ComboBoxOperator
}

package "Log" {
   class ScenarioLogger
}

package "External" {
   class "FlaUI" as FlaUI <<library>>
   class "Win32 API" as Win32 <<library>>
}

' ========================================
' Form
' ========================================
MainForm --> ScenarioLoader : loads
MainForm --> ScenarioExecutor : executes
MainForm --> ScenarioLogger : displays logs

' ========================================
' Scenario
' ========================================
ScenarioLoader --> ScenarioParser
ScenarioLoader --> ScenarioValidator
ScenarioLoader --> Scenario

Scenario "1" *-- "0..*" ScenarioStep
ScenarioStep --> ScenarioCommandType

ScenarioParser ..> Scenario : creates
ScenarioValidator ..> Scenario : validates

' ========================================
' Execution
' ========================================
ScenarioExecutor --> ScenarioCommandExecutor
ScenarioExecutor --> ScenarioLogger
ScenarioExecutor ..> ScenarioExecutionContext : creates
ScenarioExecutor ..> ScenarioExecutionResult : creates
ScenarioExecutor ..> ScenarioExecutionOptions

ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ScenarioStep
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ScenarioExecutionContext

ScenarioExecutionContext --> GuiSession
ScenarioExecutionContext --> ScenarioExecutionOptions

' ========================================
' Command -> Operator
' ========================================
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> GuiOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> MitamaOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> CalculationOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiDataOperator

' ========================================
' Automation
' ========================================
GuiOperator ..> GuiSession : creates / closes

ShikigamiOperator --> ComboBoxOperator

GuiOperator ..> FlaUI
ShikigamiOperator ..> FlaUI
MitamaOperator ..> FlaUI
CalculationOperator ..> FlaUI
ComboBoxOperator ..> FlaUI

ComboBoxOperator ..> Win32

note right of Scenario
START / END はシナリオの境界を表す。
ScenarioStep には含めない。
end note

note right of ScenarioCommandExecutor
Version 1 では ScenarioCommandType に対して
単純な switch で処理を分岐する。

Command Handler や Registry などの抽象化は、
必要になった時点で導入する。
end note

note bottom of ComboBoxOperator
WinForms ComboBox の
UI Automation 上の回避処理を隠蔽する。

Scenario および上位層は、
FlaUI / Win32 の実装詳細を意識しない。
end note

note bottom of MainForm
MainForm の責務は以下に限定する。
- Scenario ファイル選択
- Scenario 表示
- 実行 / 停止
- Watch 設定
- 実行ログ表示
end note

@enduml
